  (text "Power chain (schematic half 1): WALL -> Essager charger (5V/3A) -> UGREEN 60W cable 2m (3A) -> inline USB-C switch cable 30cm (3A) -> board USB-C (5V, 350mA). TF slot, CAN, RS485, battery header unused in v1 except SD slideshow. No soldering, plug-in parts only." (at 20 50 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "text-power"))
  (text "Display/touch (schematic half 2, manufacturer wiki verified): touch SDA GPIO8 / SCL GPIO9 / IRQ GPIO4, TP_RST via EXIO1; RGB VSYNC GPIO3 / DE GPIO5 / PCLK GPIO7 / HSYNC GPIO46; RGB data GPIO0,1,2,10,14,17,18,21,38,39,40,41,42,45,47,48; backlight DISP via EXIO2, LCD_VDD_EN via EXIO6; I2C 0x24 IO expander, 0x5D touch. Board outline 192.96 x 110.76 mm. No camera connector on SKU 31726." (at 20 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "text-display"))
